.TH dslite-b4-clear-aftr 8  "clear-aftr "
.SH NAME
dslite\-b4\-clear\-aftr \- Clear the runtime AFTR override and ask the daemon to reconcile
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBdslite\-b4 clear\-aftr\fR [\fB\-c\fR|\fB\-\-config\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Clear the runtime AFTR override and ask the daemon to reconcile
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-c\fR, \fB\-\-config\fR \fI<CONFIG>\fR [default: /etc/dslite\-b4.toml]
Read configuration from this path
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
